  "statement": "Determine the value of the sum\n\n\\[\\frac{3}{1^{2} \\cdot 2^{2}}+\\frac{5}{2^{2} \\cdot 3^{2}}+\\frac{7}{3^{2} \\cdot 4^{2}}+\\cdots+\\frac{29}{14^{2} \\cdot 15^{2}} .\\]",
