      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-algebra-2002-p8.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "224/225 The sum telescopes as\n\n\\[\\left(\\frac{1}{1^{2}}-\\frac{1}{2^{2}}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{2^{2}}-\\frac{1}{3^{2}}\\right)+\\cdots+\\left(\\frac{1}{14^{2}}-\\frac{1}{15^{2}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{1^{2}}-\\frac{1}{15^{2}}=\\frac{224}{225 .}\\]",
